# Outfit gear (R18): a press satchel at the left hip, accent flap, strap running up the side to the shoulder, steel
# buckle and a glowing press tag.
name outfit_satchel
grid 5
size 6 3 15
slot bag SwatchMain
slot flap SwatchAccent
slot buckle Steel
slot tag SwatchGlow
box 0 0 0 6 3 5 bag
box 0 0 4 6 3 5 flap
box 5 0 2 6 3 5 flap
box 5 1 2 6 2 3 buckle
box 2 1 5 4 2 15 flap
box 4 0 1 5 1 2 tag
pivot 3 2 0
